<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield falls to 4.25 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield falls to 4.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on bids by commercial banks at a repo auction by the Central Bank of Cyprus was 4.25 percent on Wednesday from 4.37 percent at the last auction on February 25, the bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 36 million pounds ($70.7 million) for the 22.5 million pounds worth of bills on offer. Yields ranged from 4.25 percent to 4.27 percent.</p>
<p>It is the third repo auction this month. ($=0.51 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
